<BaseLayout title="Decision cases" description="Ten real page-inventory validations and four publishable SEO Fan-out decision cases." canonicalPath="/beispiele/" pageClass="reference-page">
<header class="reference-hero"><p class="mono-label">Case register · verified 22 August 2026</p><h1>Real inventories. Bounded decisions. No invented outcomes.</h1><p>Ten public inventories were reviewed against method v0.1. These records show observed URLs, declared inputs, decisions and limits—not ranking or traffic improvements.</p></header>
<section class="case-status"><div><span class="status-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="mono-label">Validation state</p><h2>10 of 10 inventories reviewed · 4 cases published</h2></div><p>All sites are operated by Matthias Ramahi or commonly owned Contextter. They are first-party implementation evidence, never independent endorsement.</p></section>
<article class="reference-section" id="sf-root-tool"><div class="section-heading"><p class="mono-label">Case 1 · seo-fanout.com · merge content</p><h2>Primary SEO Fan-out tool entry</h2></div><div class="case-contract"><ol><li><strong>Observed inventory</strong><span><a href="https://seo-fanout.com/">https://seo-fanout.com/</a><br /><a href="https://seo-fanout.com/tool/">https://seo-fanout.com/tool/</a></span></li><li><strong>Declared inputs</strong><span>User job: act; coverage: overlap; evidence: observed.</span></li><li><strong>Decision</strong><span>Both paths previously served the same tool. The root now returns 308 to the self-canonical /tool/ URL.</span></li><li><strong>Evidence limit</strong><span>Routing evidence only; no search-performance outcome claimed.</span></li></ol></div></article>
<article class="reference-section" id="sf-definition"><div class="section-heading"><p class="mono-label">Case 2 · seo-fanout.com · add section</p><h2>What SEO fan-out means on this site</h2></div><div class="case-contract"><ol><li><strong>Observed inventory</strong><span><a href="https://seo-fanout.com/learn/what-seo-fan-out-means-here/">https://seo-fanout.com/learn/what-seo-fan-out-means-here/</a><br /><a href="https://seo-fanout.com/methodik/">https://seo-fanout.com/methodik/</a></span></li><li><strong>Declared inputs</strong><span>User job: learn; coverage: section_gap; evidence: primary.</span></li><li><strong>Decision</strong><span>The guide already owns the learning job. Source context belongs there instead of a new definition page.</span></li><li><strong>Evidence limit</strong><span>First-party method evidence, not independent validation.</span></li></ol></div></article>
<article class="reference-section" id="contextter-site-audit"><div class="section-heading"><p class="mono-label">Case 3 · contextter.com · no action</p><h2>Evaluate technical site-audit capability</h2></div><div class="case-contract"><ol><li><strong>Observed inventory</strong><span><a href="https://contextter.com/features/site-audit">https://contextter.com/features/site-audit</a><br /><a href="https://contextter.com/learning-center/technical-seo-audit">https://contextter.com/learning-center/technical-seo-audit</a><br /><a href="https://contextter.com/blog/site-audit-contextter-technical-seo-issues">https://contextter.com/blog/site-audit-contextter-technical-seo-issues</a></span></li><li><strong>Declared inputs</strong><span>User job: choose; coverage: substantial; evidence: primary.</span></li><li><strong>Decision</strong><span>Feature, procedure guide, and implementation article have distinct jobs; no fourth generic page is justified.</span></li><li><strong>Evidence limit</strong><span>Common operator disclosed; no conversions or GSC performance reviewed.</span></li></ol></div></article>
<article class="reference-section" id="mr-auto-synonyms"><div class="section-heading"><p class="mono-label">Case 4 · matthiasramahi.de · merge content</p><h2>Book general automobile photography</h2></div><div class="case-contract"><ol><li><strong>Observed inventory</strong><span><a href="https://matthiasramahi.de/autofotografie.html">https://matthiasramahi.de/autofotografie.html</a><br /><a href="https://matthiasramahi.de/automotive-fotografie.html">https://matthiasramahi.de/automotive-fotografie.html</a><br /><a href="https://matthiasramahi.de/fahrzeugfotografie.html">https://matthiasramahi.de/fahrzeugfotografie.html</a></span></li><li><strong>Declared inputs</strong><span>User job: choose; coverage: overlap; evidence: observed.</span></li><li><strong>Decision</strong><span>Three 200 self-canonical pages have closely related general promises. This triggers a consolidation review, not an automatic redirect.</span></li><li><strong>Evidence limit</strong><span>Check GSC, links, conversions, intent equivalence and unique media before action.</span></li></ol></div></article>
